  "claim": "Svetlana Germanovna Parkhomenko, is a retired Soviet and Russian tennis player and tennis coach, she's the bronze medalist in women's and mixed doubles, in the 1983 Summer Universiade event that took place in Edmonton, Alberta, Canada between July 1 and 12, 1983.",
